{"type":"text","timestamp":1788421043185,"sessionID":"ses_f99cd7ab0ffe6L6oTfhwdJt7eq","part":{"id":"prt_0663372c8001nDN1GtLOIeG7Bi","messageID":"msg_066337026001JhdUo43I32ZvOL","sessionID":"ses_f99cd7ab0ffe6L6oTfhwdJt7eq","type":"text","text":"\n\nAll changes have been implemented successfully. Here's a summary:\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### `Cell` class (`cell.py`)\n- Changed `_connections` from `list[Cell]` to `dict[Any, Cell]`\n- Added `connections` property providing read-only access to the dictionary\n- Updated `connect(other, key=None)` to accept an optional custom key (defaults to connected cell's coordinate)\n- Updated `disconnect(other)` to remove all connections to the given cell regardless of keys\n- Added type annotations throughout\n\n### `Grid` class (`grid.py`)\n- Modified `_connect_single_cell_*d()` and `_connect_single_cell_nd()` to use coordinate differences as connection keys (e.g., `(0, 1)` for north)\n\n### `Network` class (`network.py`)\n- Modified `_connect_single_cell()` to use node names as connection keys\n\n### `VoronoiGrid` class (`voronoi.py`)\n- Fixed to use integer indices as keys (instead of unhashable coordinate lists)\n\n### `DiscreteSpace` and `CellCollection` classes\n- Added/improved type annotations\n\n## Key Features\n- Grid cells expose connections via meaningful coordinate difference keys\n- Network cells expose connections via node name keys\n- Optional custom keys for connections\n- Disconnect removes all connections between cells regardless of keys\n- Neighborhood calculations work correctly with new structure\n- All existing tests pass","time":{"start":1788421042888,"end":1788421043182}}}
